config LISM_INPUT_PROCESSOR_POINTER_ACCEL
    bool "LisM pointer acceleration input processor"
    default y
    depends on DT_HAS_LISM_INPUT_PROCESSOR_POINTER_ACCEL_ENABLED
    help
      Scale relative pointer movement from a base CPI to a maximum effective
      CPI according to the size of each movement event.

config LISM_INPUT_PROCESSOR_AXIS_LOCK
    bool "LisM dominant-axis lock input processor"
    default y
    depends on DT_HAS_LISM_INPUT_PROCESSOR_AXIS_LOCK_ENABLED
    help
      Select the dominant pointer axis at the start of a gesture and suppress
      movement on the other axis until the gesture becomes idle.
